[E-REFL] Error: `rfl` can't prove this
   ╭─[ soundness/number-pattern-default-proof.sw:7:22 ]
   │
 7 │ isNotFound n   = Yes rfl
   │                      ─┬─  
   │                       ╰─── `n` and `404` aren't equal
